hello everyone  welcome to a special treyarch studio  broadcast i'm john raphas  and the launch of season four feels like  it was just yesterday  now we brace ourselves for the arrival  of a mid-season update and it is  filled with plenty of new content  treyarch's newest  long-anticipated zombies map arrives  this week and we figured  it'd be appropriate to kick things off  with the zombies team  we caught up with them earlier and this  is what they had to share  [Music]  hello everyone it's nice to be back i  think the  last broadcast that kevin and i did  a lot of things got bleeped out  we are very excited about murder toten  which is going to be set  in war-torn berlin it's kind of the  connection point between east and west  it's kind of  the best place for a zombies outbreak  what better  place to battle the undead than a dark  stormy night you know everything's wet  there's lights and fires reflecting off  the puddles of water  really sets a really eerie and moody  tone so in terms of where we're at in  the story at the end of outbreak's last  main quest  the requiem strike team were captured by  omega  everyone fell for our fake out with the  x-fil  obviously the tragic shooting down of  raptor one  i'm happy to say raptor one is not dead  for this map he is very much going to be  the princess  in the castle because if you don't do  what omega tell you to do  and complete their objectives rather  than the usual  objectives you're given by our usual  requiem crew they're going to kill them  so i hope that means that you're all  suitably motivated  to do the right thing players will  experience a new perk which is mule kick  mule kick this game has really embraced  its theme of  excess so it's just literally various  guns  along the sides of it and every time you  purchase the perk it has a chance to  just  shoot bullets in every direction as you  upgrade the perk you'll eventually  access  all zombies drop ammo and then you'll be  able to craft  twice the amount of equipment for the  same cost finally you'll be able to  actually have a chance to not even  consume equipment when you use it  the new wonder weapon for it's called  the crbrs  or you can just call it the cerberus i'm  really excited about this one as it  takes me back to  my days in the arcades playing  shoot-em-ups where you  you know get power-ups for your ship and  change the way your weapon functions  the base version has a little companion  sphere whenever you fire it fires  when you kill enemies it will drop a mod  kit  and then it becomes a different weapon  so the first mod kit is the diffuser the  diffuser  has a spreadshot of five shots at once  blazer fires a beam of concentrated  energy  now the swarm will fire a salvo of  miniature missiles that have a bunch of  explosions  so another thing we weren't allowed to  talk about last time  was the introduction of a new character  called klaus  who is very much an ai helper through  this level  who has his own backstory and also i  think some of the funniest lines that  we've had  and american-made roblox is a german  personality that was what kevin and i  were laughing about last time  class is going to be a very important  member of our team  because there are things that only he  can deal with do this  do that story of my life we're also  introducing a new tactical equipment  called the lt-53 chasm what it does is  it creates a black hole when it's tossed  that allows you to jump in and escape  but the happy side effect of this thing  is that it actually pulls in all the  zombies  and they go poof too one of the new  enemies  in our duton is the tormentor tormentor  is a very fast suicide charge enemy  the newest enemy to join our ranks is  the disciple  he's all about being in the space making  the zombies nearby stronger  and trying to evade the player he floats  above the the zombies so he stands out  which the map really takes advantage of  because he can be on top of  tanks or vehicles another enemy that  shows up in bauer de toten  is the krasny soldier now this guy is  really well suited to  the ups and downs of this map i think  players are really gonna  notice the verticality players are gonna  be able to move from  the rooftops all the way down to the go  station  down there are these like flaming trains  that are full of zombies  so you gotta watch out up on the surface  we'll have zip lines that'll  take players up and down between the  streets and the roofs pretty quickly  as with every new round based map we  also introduced new challenges unique to  the map really tied into the intel that  we're delivering i doubt you realize  what she has done we also have another  dark ops challenge  tied with the main quest a new feature  we're adding to all round based maps  is dynamic wall buys every five rounds  every wall buy has a chance to  increase its rear all the way up to  legendary when you get to really high  rounds all the wall buys will  eventually become legendary we are going  to be bringing some  new health changes to zombies so what we  did  was we lowered the health cap across the  board you're gonna be able to  effectively kill zombies  at the highest rounds where it feels  good we're also adding  weaver as an operator this is weaver  when he recently lost his eye and this  is the version of weaver that you're  going to be able to play as  he certainly appreciated not just being  sat behind his desk  watching other people do all the the fun  stuff  we're going to be bringing rush to  onslaught and an entirely new limited  time mode called  onslaught accelerated which is going to  be the most frantic version  of the mode we've seen the orb will  constantly  be moving and never stopping the orb  waits for nobody so unless you're  killing them efficiently  you're really going to get overwhelmed  fast but to add a little  something to it as you kill zombies the  ore moves even faster  we all know that people have been  eagerly anticipating a new round-based  map for quite a while and we've been  working  very very very hard on it and we really  believe that when people  finish the main quest in this they're  going to be shocked  and they're also going to be very  excited about where we go next  while zombies serves up quite the undead  update  multiplayer is also bringing the heat  with a number of updates  on the map front treyarch is excited to  bring a black ops 2 classic into the mix  rush and its epic paintball theme is  coming back  for a new generation in this 6v6 map  players will enjoy a variety of lanes  and engagements with something for  everyone  can't get enough of this classic we've  got good news for you  players will also have the opportunity  to jump into rush 24 7.  to keep the theme going players can also  enjoy the new paintball mosh pit  available in 656 with paintball impact  visuals and sounds  later in the season capture the flag is  a classic mode that returns to the fray  one of the original multiplayer modes  from the early days of call of duty  is back for players who fell in love  with die hardpoint during the 80s summer  action event  we're upping the ante with cranked mosh  pit  this new playlist will include cranked  team deathmatch and cranked kill  confirmed for the first time  there are two new weapons that we'll see  as well the ots9 smg  at mid-season launch and the brutal mace  melee weapon coming later in the season  also in the multiplayer mix the team is  rolling out new  league play rewards which will feature  weapon blueprints added for achieving  milestones  as well as new cdl themed weapon charms  new emblems  stickers and xp bonuses for hitting win  milestones all the way to 100 players  will also find new weapon blueprints  joining the prestige shop for the first  time  including the new dark horse smg and  the confrontation assault rifle there  are a few surprises in store for fans of  warzone as well  with this mid-season update warzone and  the team at raven serve up a new game  mode  a team-based ltm that's focused on  escorting icbms  what could possibly go wrong exactly and  that's where it gets fun  payload is a team-based ltm that's  focused on escorting  icbms dividing players into two teams  attackers and defenders the attacker's  objective is to deliver the payload to  the final destination by pushing it  and the defender's objective is to stop  the attackers from pushing the payload  to its final destination  the clock is ticking however a time  limit will be imposed so get to it  warzone also delivers a new kill streak  the sentry gun  this latest kill streak for warzone  operates as you'd expect from  multiplayer  scanning for targets in the radius in  front while it's deployed  it is an extremely rare loot drop in  game  players will also get to experience a  special global event in season  where contraband contracts automatically  spawn after players complete two regular  contracts  these contracts will provide the  opportunity to earn plenty of weapon  blueprints from your prior seasons  so keep a lookout later in the season  finally  players have the opportunity to gift the  battle pass  battle pass bundle and store bundles to  friends in warzone  starting with season four reloaded in  closing  we'd like to thank the zombies team for  stopping by giving us their time  giving us the download on all things  malware dear token  thank you to our crew tommy ben foxy and  thank  you for tuning in we hope you enjoy  everything that this update has to offer  we hope to see you online  that's me alluding to max's but  you can't use the bit that i just said i  want to spoil it

